<title>USA: King Cty, Wash., $130 mln GOs won by Goldman Sachs.</title>
<headline>King Cty, Wash., $130 mln GOs won by Goldman Sachs.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs &amp; Co said Monday it won $130.3 million King County, Wash., general obligation bonds at a true interest cost of 5.59 percent.</p>
</text>
